    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-29T18:13:25+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-29T18:13:25+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-29T07:43:25Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-29T07:43:25Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A ridge of high pressure lies over eastern parts of SA, while a low pressure system in WA extends a trough into the west. The low and trough will move across the state on Friday, clearing to the east by Saturday morning as a brief high pressure system settles over SA. Another low is expected to enter from the west on Sunday, moving over central and eastern parts on Monday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-29T15:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-30T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-29T04:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-29T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower north of Oodnadatta, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Leigh Creek. Winds east to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-30T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-31T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-29T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-30T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers about the Gammon Ranges, medium chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm. Winds east to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h turning north to northwesterly 25 to 40 km/h during the morning then tending northwest to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 12 and 22 with daytime temperatures reaching 30 to 35.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">High</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:10am to 4:50pm, UV Index predicted to reach 11 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-31T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-01T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-30T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-31T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Winds northwest to northeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northwest to southwesterly before dawn then tending south to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h in the early morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 16 and 23 with daytime temperatures reaching 30 to 38.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-01T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-02T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-31T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-01T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. The chance of morning fog south of Yunta. Medium chance of showers south of Yunta, most likely in the afternoon and evening. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. Winds southeast to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h tending northeast to southeasterly 25 to 35 km/h during the morning then tending northwest to northeasterly during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to between 12 and 22 with daytime temperatures reaching 32 to 40.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-02T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-03T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-01T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-02T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower. The chance of a thunderstorm. Winds northwest to northeasterly 25 to 35 km/h tending northwest to southwesterly 25 to 40 km/h during the day then tending south to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 19 and 27 with daytime temperatures reaching 33 to 41.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
